<li>A <a class="group inline" href="https://console.neon.tech/signup" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Neon account<span class="whitespace-nowrap no-underline"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 14 14" class="ml-1 inline-block size-3.5! shrink-0 align-[-0.125em]"><path fill="currentColor" d="M0 0h14v14H0z" opacity="0.2"></path><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="square" d="M9.915 8.885V4.08H5.11M9.625 4.375 4.083 9.917"></path></svg></span></a></li>
<li>Basic familiarity with ASP.NET Core and Entity Framework Core</li>
</ul>
